description: 
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
The project uses Tailwind CSS; use Tailwind classes instead of writing custom CSS, wherever
possible. In particular, do not hardcode *any* media query dimensions into CSS, but use the viewport
dimensions defined in [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts).

When writing CSS, when values that are re-used more than once in the styling, create variables for
them. When designing Next.js/React/TS components with UI parameters, prefer to store them in
[ui-config.ts](mdc:lib/ui-config.ts). 

Do not try to run `npm run dev`!

